# CS Students Data Analysis

This is a beginner-friendly data analysis project based on `pandas`.  
The project analyzes a student dataset and covers the basic workflow of data loading, data checking, data cleaning, feature engineering, and statistical analysis.

## Project Goals

The main goals of this project are to practice:

- Reading CSV files with pandas
- Checking basic dataset information
- Cleaning duplicated records and invalid values
- Standardizing column names and text fields
- Creating new features from existing columns
- Performing basic statistical analysis
- Organizing a small data analysis project for GitHub

## Project Structure

```text
cs-students-analysis/
│
├── main.py              # Main Python script
├── cs_students.csv      # Raw dataset
├── README.md            # Project documentation
├── .gitignore           # Git ignored files
│
├── outputs/             # Output files
└── figures/             # Generated figures